2026-09-07T01:59:25.075Z [dev/opencode] (stderr)        ./start.sh exp <slug> [server-options]
2026-09-07T01:59:25.075Z [dev/opencode] (stderr)   exp <slug>    Start Ralph Kanban with --repo set to experiments/<slug> (absolute path).
2026-09-07T01:59:25.075Z [dev/opencode] (stderr)                 Then open http://localhost:3001 and run the loop from the UI (or pass --start).
