2026-09-07T02:13:38.150Z [dev/opencode] (stderr) ## Proposed implementation order
2026-09-07T02:13:38.150Z [dev/opencode] (stderr) 1. **C** session child cleanup (unblocks correct directed-send targets).
2026-09-07T02:13:38.150Z [dev/opencode] (stderr) 2. **A** End blank (same present-push / program-state path).
2026-09-07T02:13:38.150Z [dev/opencode] (stderr) 3. **D** thumbnail fidelity + placement (depends on shared program state from A).
2026-09-07T02:13:38.150Z [dev/opencode] (stderr) 4. **B** theme prefs durability (may share prefs root with E).
2026-09-07T02:13:38.150Z [dev/opencode] (stderr) 5. **E** library `~/.poster` + migration + setting (largest; last so prefs root is settled).
2026-09-07T02:13:38.150Z [dev/opencode] (stderr) Or: **E first** if Roy prioritizes data survival over Present UX — call out in go message.
2026-09-07T02:13:38.150Z [dev/opencode] (stderr) ## Risks
2026-09-07T02:13:38.150Z [dev/opencode] (stderr) - Theme prefs today may already be intended durable but writing to wrong path (cwd vs userData vs `~/.poster`) — fix path, don’t invent a second store.
2026-09-07T02:13:38.150Z [dev/opencode] (stderr) - Thumbnail “exact look” may need capture from Present contents vs re-render; fidelity bar = **same program payload / content markers**, not bit-identical pixels (no visual-diff gate in CI unless Roy asks).
2026-09-07T02:13:38.150Z [dev/opencode] (stderr) - Closing Home still kills all windows — out of scope unless Roy expands.
2026-09-07T02:13:38.150Z [dev/opencode] (stderr) - **Test risks (Jack):** Electron quit/relaunch smoke flaky without isolated `--user-data-dir`; AppImage cwd fools prefs/library path tests if `HOME` fixture omitted; Item D Mac-only FAIL vs Linux PASS means CI green can still miss Mac placement/fidelity — keep Mac manual in DoD for D.
2026-09-07T02:13:38.150Z [dev/opencode] (stderr) - POC `mainSwitch` already has “close drops present from list” — production may not share that path; harness must target **real** main session module, not only POC.
2026-09-07T02:13:38.150Z [dev/opencode] (stderr) ## Locked decisions (Roy, 2026-09-06)
2026-09-07T02:13:38.150Z [dev/opencode] (stderr) 1. Library folder change: **re-point and leave old** (no automatic move).
2026-09-07T02:13:38.150Z [dev/opencode] (stderr) 2. First-run: **default `~/.poster`** with optional **“Change…”** (no forced picker).
2026-09-07T02:13:38.150Z [dev/opencode] (stderr) 3. Impl order: **either is fine** — default remains C → A → D → B → E unless go message picks otherwise.
2026-09-07T02:13:38.150Z [dev/opencode] (stderr) 4. Merge gate: **Jack confirm required before merge** (not Moe packaged confirm as a hard gate; Moe still welcome for packaged smoke).
