2026-09-07T04:10:14.435Z [dev/opencode] (stderr) 1. Update the **relevant canonical doc** ([`ralph/epic.md`](ralph/epic.md), [`docs/epics/`](docs/epics/), [`README.md`](README.md)).
2026-09-07T04:10:14.435Z [dev/opencode] (stderr) 2. Adjust **this file** so automated or human task loops still have one checklist.
