2026-09-07T06:34:26.294Z [dev/opencode] # Fix Electron Home Change... re-point
2026-09-07T06:34:26.294Z [dev/opencode] ## Summary
2026-09-07T06:34:26.294Z [dev/opencode] The Home `Change...` control used `window.prompt`, which is unsupported in Electron renderers, so operators could not re-point the library root in the packaged app. Replaced it with a native folder-picker bridge (`window.poster.pickLibraryFolder`) when present, keeping `window.prompt` as the browser fallback.
2026-09-07T06:34:26.294Z [dev/opencode] ## Changes Made
2026-09-07T06:34:26.294Z [dev/opencode] - **`electron/main.cjs`**: Imported `dialog` and added `ipcMain.handle('poster:pick-library-folder', ...)` that opens a native `dialog.showOpenDialog` (bound to the calling window) with `openDirectory` + `createDirectory` properties, returning the selected path or `null` on cancel.
